;; APQC PCF citation catalog for axis-ingest.
;;
;; Live apqc.org returns 403 to automated clients (bot control), so identity
;; citations go through Wayback Machine snapshots that still answer 200.
;; BPMN citations are the mapping target this repo's README claims; they are
;; fetched from omg.org directly. Self-surface raw.githubusercontent / GitHub
;; API URLs pin the published leaf claim.
;;
;; Gate: `nbb tools/verify_citations.kotoba` must exit 0. Do not add a URL that
;; does not return 2xx under that gate.

{:catalog/id "org-apqc-pcf/v1"
 :catalog/about
 "Open APQC Process Classification Framework (PCF) surface. L1 taxonomy is
  published under kotoba/; this catalog pins the public sources that make
